span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">초등돌봄교실에서 대학생들의 봉사활동은 사회봉사활동 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">교육봉사활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">교원양성기관의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">실적으로 인정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">위와 관련하여 능력과 재능을 겸비한 대학생들이 초등돌봄교실 자원봉사 활동에 참여할 수 있도록 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">“2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">년 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">기 대학생 동아리 돌봄교실 봉사단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">을모집</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">코자 하오니 참고&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><t